  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tertiary Education Institute Annual Workshop 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This annual workshop is for representatives of tertiary education institutes (TEIs) that participate in the Manaaki New Zealand Scholarship Programme (MNZSP). The workshop is a necessary element of the MNZSP to ensure consistent high quality service delivery across the TEIs. Their delivery is the determining factor for a positive scholarship experience. A positive scholarship experience is the determining factor for scholar affinity with New Zealand.</narrative>
  </description>
